Primary containment: 64mm cast iron cylindrical outer housing — rigid high-mass enstrophy containment boundary. Waveguide: interior-threaded outer pipe acting as non-linear geometric waveguide. Magnetic seeding: permanent donut magnets in attracting configuration (present approximately 6–7 months of total operational history only). Base: dual aerated steel plates. Documented magnetometer reading during active operation: 36–38 μT (Magna-AR overlay, July 19, 2026).

